# Brix Chat — environment variables (local-first defaults; nothing required)
#
# Copy to .env to enable the Supabase transport. With these unset the app runs
# 100% on its localStorage transport (offline, demo data in this browser).
#
# Backend setup (tables, RLS, realtime): see supabase/README.md

# Supabase project URL, e.g. https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase ANON (publishable) key — safe for browser use.
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NEVER set a service-role key here. Frontend code must never see it:
# the client (src/lib/supabase-client.ts) warns and ignores
# VITE_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY if present.
